      "writtenOn": "2022-11-21T18:33:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this part doesn\u0027t work very well. We need the node\u0027s parent in `FdtNodeMut::appendprop_addrrange` but returning an `FdtNodeMut` would mean duplicating the mutable reference `FdtNodeMut::fdt`, causing issues with the borrow checker:\n```\nOk(Self { fdt: self.fdt, offset: fdt_err(ret)? })\n               ^^^^^^^^ `self` is a `\u0026` reference, so the data it refers to cannot be borrowed as mutable\n```",
